@DISTRO_ID@-hw-legion (0.1.2) @BASE_SERIES@; urgency=medium

  * Keep only what is specific to this model, /etc/@DISTRO_ID@/gpu: the other
    dependencies serve every machine and moved (docs/7 choice 44): fwupd to
    @DISTRO_ID@-base with fwupd-signed, intel-media-va-driver-non-free to
    @DISTRO_ID@-session, @DISTRO_ID@-hybrid-backlight to @DISTRO_ID@-nvidia,
    nvidia-vaapi-driver to @DISTRO_ID@-drivers-install; firmware-sof-signed,
    alsa-ucm-conf, linux-firmware, bolt and asdcontrol already came with
    @DISTRO_ID@-base, the kernel and @DISTRO_ID@-desktop.

