@DISTRO_ID@-hw-legion (0.1.1) @BASE_SERIES@; urgency=medium

  * Name the Intel GPU in /etc/@DISTRO_ID@/gpu, read by @DISTRO_ID@-session's user
    environment generator, instead of a static environment.d file: Hyprland's
    backend fails to start when AQ_DRM_DEVICES holds the by-path symlink, so
    the generator resolves the name to the card's node at login (QEMU,
    2026-10-11).

